meta {
  name: Upsert profile - bad salary
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/profile
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "skills": ["Python"],
    "seniority": "pleno",
    "salary_expectation": [
      {
        "currency": "BRL",
        "contract": "PJ",
        "floor": 18000,
        "target": 15000,
        "ceiling": 12000
      }
    ]
  }
}

docs {
  The salary range violates `0 < floor <= target <= ceiling` (floor > ceiling).
  Rejecting this prevents the Matcher (M3) from reading the range as
  "any salary ok" (fail-open).

  Expected: 422 Unprocessable Entity
}
